{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to the world of ArcanaTris!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a new way to play puzzle blocks! Choose a companion, score points, and level up! With each level, you can select power-ups to go even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580650/extras/02.gif?t=1742859173\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you prefer, play the classic mode and challenge yourself to break records!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580650/extras/classic-gif.gif?t=1742859173\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Local Multiplayer Modes </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Duel</strong> \u2013 Face off against another player in a score battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580650/extras/duel-01.gif?t=1742859173\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd1d <strong>Coop</strong> \u2013 Play as a team and score points together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580650/extras/coop-01.gif?t=1742859173\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plus, track your stats and unlock exclusive <strong>achievements</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Come, the world of ArcanaTris awaits you!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3580650?t=1742859173","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3580650?t=1742859173","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580650/a6a17c76f25e30bb7caf13148d107ad88fc2677d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742859173","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s